- After this chunk, an adopt whose child ends before any `session-start` reached the wrapper ends exit 1:
  - one fixed `unable:` / `hint:` pair on stderr, after the child has released the terminal;
  - under `--json`, one document `{"v":1,"error":"not-resumed","detail":null}`, stderr empty;
  - one `process-exit{subject:"self", exit_code:1, detail:"not-resumed"}` in `run-<name>.ndjson` in place of today's
    exit-0 line.

- Spec anchors:
  - `(design-system · contract/cli-exit-codes/1-adopt-start)`, `(design-system · contract/viola-run-output/child-started)`,
    `(design-system · decision/no-json-after-child-held-terminal)`;
  - `(architecture · contract/cli-json-output/adopt-refusal-codes)`;
  - `(obs-plan · decision/adopt-start-logs-as-run)`, `(obs-plan · contract/process-exit-detail/exit-1-adopt)`,
    `(obs-plan · decision/exit-1-detail-codes)`, `(obs-plan · decision/adopt-session-id-never-logged)`;
  - `(a11y-plan · contract/cli-refusal/unable-line)`, `(a11y-plan · contract/viola-revive-json/pump-child-error)`;
  - `(test-plan · decision/fake-agent-argv-only)`, `(test-plan · decision/adopt-proven-live)`.

- After this chunk, an adopt whose child ends before any `session-start` reached the wrapper ends exit 1:
  - one fixed pair on stderr, after the child has released the terminal: `unable: <name>'s session did not resume`
    then `hint: check the session id - claude --resume <id> must open it by hand, under the same claude config`;
  - under `--json`, one document `{"v":1,"error":"not-resumed","detail":null}`, stderr empty;
  - one `process-exit{subject:"self", exit_code:1, detail:"not-resumed"}` in `run-<name>.ndjson` in place of today's
    exit-0 line.
